{"id":"0b5f8f9704ff7a5a","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-set9-pointwise-union.md","title":"Pointwise Union of Set-Valued Functions","display":"df-zfc-set9-pointwise-union — Pointwise Union of Set-Valued Functions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set9-pointwise-union","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set9-pointwise-union"],"display":"df-zfc-set9-pointwise-union — Pointwise Union of Set-Valued Functions","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set9-pointwise-union"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set9-pointwise-union</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set9-pointwise-union — Pointwise Union of Set-Valued Functions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-zfc-set9-pointwise-union-—-ZFC-Set9-Pointwise-Union\">df-zfc-set9-pointwise-union — ZFC Set9 Pointwise Union</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,\\mathcal F,I,Y,x\\in V\">\\(U,\\mathcal F,I,Y,x\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9PointwiseUnion}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet9PointwiseUnion}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}union} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet9PointwiseUnion}_S(U,\\mathcal F,x,I,Y)\\leftrightarrow x\\in I\\land U\\subseteq Y\\land\\bigl(\\forall f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\mathrm{Function}(f,I,\\mathcal P(Y))\\bigr)\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\bigl(y\\in U\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\;(y\\in f(x))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}union} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet9PointwiseUnion}_S(U,\\mathcal F,x,I,Y)\\leftrightarrow x\\in I\\land U\\subseteq Y\\land\\bigl(\\forall f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\mathrm{Function}(f,I,\\mathcal P(Y))\\bigr)\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\bigl(y\\in U\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\;(y\\in f(x))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Equivalently, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=\\bigcup_{f\\in\\mathcal F}f(x)\">\\(U=\\bigcup_{f\\in\\mathcal F}f(x)\\)</span>; the typing clause ensures every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)\">\\(f(x)\\)</span> is a subset of the common codomain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Parentheses terminate the function-typing quantifier before the membership biconditional; in particular, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F=\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathcal F=\\varnothing\\)</span> now forces <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=\\varnothing\">\\(U=\\varnothing\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-zfc-set9-pointwise-union-—-ZFC-Set9-Pointwise-Union","text":"df-zfc-set9-pointwise-union — ZFC Set9 Pointwise Union","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U,\\mathcal F,I,Y,x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9PointwiseUnion}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}union} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet9PointwiseUnion}_S(U,\\mathcal F,x,I,Y)\\leftrightarrow x\\in I\\land U\\subseteq Y\\land\\bigl(\\forall f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\mathrm{Function}(f,I,\\mathcal P(Y))\\bigr)\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\bigl(y\\in U\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathcal F\\;(y\\in f(x))\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"U=\\bigcup_{f\\in\\mathcal F}f(x)","display":false},{"tex":"f(x)","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"U=\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":1285,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3464","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-set9-pointwise-union.md|58-df-zfc-set9-pointwise-union]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","2b6b1d9eb78a2714","65d9a1e690c32aad"]}